NOTEX="Indeks telesne mase (ITM) je podatek, ki upošteva razmerje med telesno težo posameznika v kilogramih in kvadratom telesne višine posameznika v metrih. Prikazani so deleži oseb, ki spadaj v naslednje 4 skupine ITM: podhranjeni (ITM 18,49 ali manj), "
"normalno hranjeni (ITM 18,50 do 24,99) èezmerno hranjeni (ITM 25,00 do 29,99), debeli (ITM 30 ali veè).";
NOTEX[en]="Body Mass Index (BMI) is calculated. BMI is an indicator that reflects the ratio between an individual’s body weight in kilograms and the square of their height in metres. The shares of persons are presented according to the following four BMI "
"categories: underfed (BMI 18.49 or less), normally fed (BMI 18.50 to 24.99), overfed (BMI 25.00 to 29.99), obese (BMI 30 or more).";
NOTEX("KATEGORIJE INDEKSA TELESNE MASE (ITM)")="Podatki se nanašajo na osebe, stare 16 let ali veè.#Nekateri seštevki se zaradi zaokroževanja ne ujemajo.#";
NOTEX[en]("CATEGORIES OF BODY MASS INDEX (BMI)")="The data refer to persons aged 16 and over.#Some totals do not add up due to rounding.##";
NOTEX("LETO")="Rezultati statistiènega raziskovanja SILC izhajajo iz ankete, izvedene v zaèetku posameznega leta, in iz registrov ter administrativnih virov, ki se veèinoma nanašajo na leto pred izvedbo ankete.";
NOTEX[en]("YEAR")="The results of SILC are based on a survey conducted in the beginning of the year and on register and administrative data mostly referring to one year before survey is conducted.";
